   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Fast modes die out. The slowest shrinks by 1 - eps *\nlambda2 a tick. With eps = 0.05, lambda2 is 0.59 on the\nring, 8 on the complete graph and 0 on two groups.",
   "originalText": "Fast modes die out. The slowest shrinks by 1 - eps *\nlambda2 a tick. With eps = 0.05, lambda2 is 0.59 on the\nring, 8 on the complete graph and 0 on two groups.",
